## 🏗️ openOODA V2 Architecture (Achieved)

### 1. V2 Zero-Trust Capability Model
Fractured legacy sandbox capabilities (`SysCap`, `NetCap`) into 18 granular, cryptographically-backed hardware tokens using OS-level entropy (`getentropy()`).
* **Audit & Trust**: `AuditCap`, `SignCap`, `HitlCap`
* **Process Execution**: `ProcessCap`, `SyncCap`, `MemCap`
* **Network Granularity**: `HttpCap`, `TcpCap`, `UdpCap`, `BindCap`
* **Hardware & Peripherals**: `AudioCap`, `CameraCap`, `UsbCap`, `HidCap`
* **Display**: `WindowCap`, `FrameCap`
* **Filesystem**: `FsReadCap`, `FsWriteCap`

### 2. The AI & Math Ecosystem
The first natively safe, memory-deterministic Machine Learning framework:
* **Matrix Core**: Zero-allocation 2D Matrix mathematics (`std/src/ooda/math/matrix.oo`) [STATUS: residual — std crypto / math primitives all gated]
* **Capability-Gated AI Agents**: Neural network controllers mathematically bounded by `AuditCap` (`std/src/ooda/ai/agent.oo`)
* **Networked AI Inference**: Pure `.oo` feed-forward layers (`dense.oo`) and integer activations (`relu`, `step`).
